From 6550fc6b3551cdadd876c71ac7b4a3a9993dba92 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: grubbychicken <ben@grbychkn.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 16:13:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] ML4 M2 X6 P1: fp16 prefill trellis GEMM for K3 mul1
 (k_gemm_tr_h16 format 1)

- bind_prefill.cuh: G6_PF_H16 (Flash or ML4) for the fp16 GEMM family (Xq::h16, shx_store_h16, k_gemm_tr_h16 with
  its fp32 rotation epilogue, the h16 mid pass); k_gemm_tr_h16 / GTH16 templated on the dtr format (0: K4 E4M3 mcg,
  1: K3 mul1, 96-byte tiles, shared memory >= the epilogue staging); Gemm::fmt (ML4 builds only); make_gemm_tr binds
  ML4 matrices as h16 format 1
- dtr_ml4_test / dtr_ml4_ref.py: the prefill GEMM over DTR_R rows (NAME.gemm.bin) checked against ExLlamaV3

Checked: wq / wo / layer-0 gate, up, down at 200 rows rel 2.8-3.0e-4 vs fp32 x @ W_eff (fp16 output); GLM and
GLM-Flash dtr_test SASS identical to HEAD.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
