From a1ceae51ca357da5d3e80e561ea7fb32692090e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: grubbychicken <ben@grbychkn.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 16:38:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] ML4 M2 X6 P2: ML4 prefill (fp16 GEMMs, ML4 router,
 experts with the shared row as Expert::shr)

- bind_prefill.cuh: the fp16 expert machinery (Expert::h16, scratch layout, H16 kernel paths) under G6_PF_H16;
  bindp::NEXP = the routed experts (128 on ML4, the shared row 128 is Expert::shr expert NEXP); non-block-scale
  kernels for mul1 under ML4; k_pf_route_ml4 (glue::k_router_plan_ml4 selection and weights); Blas16 (fp16 cuBLAS,
  fp32 accumulate), k_f16w_plain (F16W record -> plain fp16), make_layer_ml4 (wq / wo / layer 0 MLP as k_gemm_tr_h16
  format 1, kv_a / indexer / router as Blas16, experts h16 mul1 with tr3.kmix and shr)
- prefill.cuh: ML4 buffers and plain copies at build (GR8_PF_OWN / --pfv2 / GR8_PF_ATTN_ROWS refused), pf_layer_ml4,
